# Wiki Syncthing runtime state (not source)
wiki/syncthing/home/

# Live family wiki vault is on the Docker host, not in this clone.
# Canonical path (T3): /mnt/internal/wiki. The old plan default
# /opt/data/wiki is wrong on this host; ignore both as a safety net if
# those trees ever appear under the clone.
# Do NOT ignore the tracked wiki/ module (compose.yml, rclone/, README,
# Dockerfile, bootstrap script). health/secrets/obsidian/ is already
# covered by **/secrets/.
/mnt/internal/wiki/
/opt/data/wiki/
/wiki-vault/
# Accidental bootstrap into the tracked module
/wiki/primary/
/wiki/secondary/
/wiki/shared/
/wiki/.obsidian/
# Obsidian runtime if someone opens the clone as a vault. Keep the rest
# of .obsidian (app.json / community plugins) if it is ever tracked.
.obsidian/cache/
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
**/.obsidian/cache/
**/.obsidian/workspace.json
**/.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json

# T8 ingest scratch if someone writes a vault or jsonl under the clone
health/docs/plans/t8-artifacts/

